# ─── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
**/.precomp/
# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally TRACKED — duallity builds standalone (it is
# not a workspace member) and pins its path-dependency resolution.

# ─── Documentation: diagram render by-products ────────────────────────────────
# Diagram sources (docs/diagrams/src/*.puml, *.d2, *.dot) and their rendered
# .svg outputs ARE committed — see docs/diagrams/README.md. Everything below is
# a transient by-product of re-rendering them.
docs/diagrams/**/err.txt
docs/diagrams/**/*.png
docs/diagrams/**/*.pdf

# ─── Benchmarking & profiling artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
perf.data
perf.data.old
*.perf
flamegraph.svg
massif.out.*
callgrind.out.*
cachegrind.out.*
# Intel VTune result directories (r000hs/, r001ue/, …)
/r[0-9][0-9][0-9]*/

# ─── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Local, machine-specific tool state ───────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─── Coq/Rocq proof build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Proof SOURCES (proofs/coq/*.v, _CoqProject, Makefile, proofs/verify.sh) ARE
# committed; everything below is a transient by-product of building them.
proofs/coq/CoqMakefile
proofs/coq/CoqMakefile.conf
proofs/coq/.CoqMakefile.d
proofs/coq/*.vo
proofs/coq/*.vok
proofs/coq/*.vos
proofs/coq/*.glob
proofs/coq/*.aux
proofs/coq/.*.aux
